1
00:00:01,485 --> 00:00:04,953
Black Hook Strikes Back

2
00:00:08,131 --> 00:00:09,102
What's all this?

3
00:00:09,102 --> 00:00:11,673
All of these are my inventions.

4
00:00:11,673 --> 00:00:15,919
Buster Gallon, self proclaimed genius inventor on planet Machina.

5
00:00:15,919 --> 00:00:18,588
You could have left out the "self proclaimed" part...

6
00:00:18,588 --> 00:00:19,527
Is this a pen?

7
00:00:19,527 --> 00:00:23,300
That is a cheat pen that will automatically write the correct answers for you.

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,114
With this I could be the top of the cl-

9
00:00:25,114 --> 00:00:26,454
Auckpth!

10
00:00:27,902 --> 00:00:32,472
It's actually a pen that punishes those who would try to cheat with it.

11
00:00:32,472 --> 00:00:33,895
And... what's this?

12
00:00:33,895 --> 00:00:37,106
It's a brush that makes your hair beautiful with just one stroke.

13
00:00:37,106 --> 00:00:38,750
Wow, really?

14
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:42,901
See? Beautiful, isn't it?

15
00:00:42,901 --> 00:00:45,468
These inventions are all pretty silly...

16
00:00:45,468 --> 00:00:47,271
But aren't they fun?

17
00:00:47,271 --> 00:00:48,509
What do you mean?

18
00:00:48,509 --> 00:00:49,753
What's so fun about this?!

19
00:00:49,753 --> 00:00:54,948
To me, it's the most fun to see the ridiculous look on people's faces after they've been tricked!

20
00:00:54,948 --> 00:00:57,399
Really? That's what you find "fun"?

21
00:00:57,399 --> 00:01:00,158
Are we sure we should accept this prankster as our teammate?

22
00:01:00,158 --> 00:01:02,503
No way! Can trust him as far as you can throw him!

23
00:01:02,503 --> 00:01:03,420
I have to agree.

24
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:05,186
I don't trust him either.

25
00:01:05,186 --> 00:01:07,906
No... But he... oh...

26
00:01:07,906 --> 00:01:09,149
I trust him!

27
00:01:09,149 --> 00:01:10,442
What?!

28
00:01:10,442 --> 00:01:11,331
Jun?!

29
00:01:11,331 --> 00:01:12,962
Why not? He's so fun!

30
00:01:12,962 --> 00:01:15,373
I enjoy a good prank too, you know!

31
00:01:15,373 --> 00:01:16,480
I think you're being too trusting.

32
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:20,480
You'll regret it if you end up getting stabbed in the back. But by then, it'll be too late.

33
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:24,393
But... if you keep expecting the worst of someone, you'll never build any trust!

34
00:01:24,393 --> 00:01:26,438
I'll trust you. Jun.

35
00:01:26,438 --> 00:01:27,198
Great!

36
00:01:27,198 --> 00:01:30,387
Then that means you can trust me in that we can trust Buster Gallon!

37
00:01:30,387 --> 00:01:32,718
What does that even mean?

38
00:01:33,539 --> 00:01:37,539
Anyway! Welcome to the team! It's great to have you, Buster Gallon!

39
00:01:38,867 --> 00:01:39,768
Hm?

40
00:01:39,768 --> 00:01:41,620
What's going on?

41
00:01:44,210 --> 00:01:45,486
What's wrong?

42
00:01:45,486 --> 00:01:46,986
Is it a power outage?

43
00:01:49,829 --> 00:01:51,652
What's going on?

44
00:01:51,652 --> 00:01:52,579
What's happening?

45
00:01:54,668 --> 00:01:57,378
This doesn't seem like a simple blackout.

46
00:01:57,378 --> 00:02:00,376
The current dropped, but it hasn't stopped completely.

47
00:02:00,376 --> 00:02:02,852
Do you think there could be a problem at the power plant?

48
00:02:02,852 --> 00:02:05,534
Huh? Daddy?! Is that true?!

49
00:02:05,534 --> 00:02:06,968
What is it, Anna?

50
00:02:06,968 --> 00:02:09,626
A strange ship has appeared at Mowtown's electrical facility!

51
00:02:09,626 --> 00:02:10,931
What?! Is it...

52
00:02:10,931 --> 00:02:12,430
It's Black Hook!

53
00:02:17,545 --> 00:02:21,274
Hahahaha! Give me everything you've got!

54
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:26,646
Aah! At this rate, the entire city will be shut down!

55
00:02:26,646 --> 00:02:27,800
Hurry! We gotta stop him!

56
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,318
Got it!

57
00:02:29,318 --> 00:02:30,485
Black Hook...

58
00:02:30,485 --> 00:02:32,277
Everyone, take back!

59
00:02:36,471 --> 00:02:40,432
I wonder... what is he trying to do by attacking the electrical facility?

60
00:02:40,432 --> 00:02:45,150
Black Hook is trying to absorb all of the electricity to power himself up!

61
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:49,103
Trying to take in all of that energy at once... Typical of Black Hook!

62
00:02:52,444 --> 00:02:54,349
That sure is one greedy pirate.

63
00:02:54,349 --> 00:02:58,569
He was already strong in the first place! We'll never beat him if he absorbs all that power.

64
00:02:59,247 --> 00:03:01,758
Theo! Anna! I have an idea!

65
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:07,377
Yahaha!

66
00:03:07,377 --> 00:03:10,710
Still not enough! More! MORE!

67
00:03:18,634 --> 00:03:21,843
Anyone who interrupts my meal will be crushed!

68
00:03:22,764 --> 00:03:23,520
Huh?

69
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,211
What?!

70
00:03:25,949 --> 00:03:27,983
Water Splash!

71
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,271
Let's go! Mega Ambler!

72
00:03:36,299 --> 00:03:38,560
Mega Ambler, Forceps Shock!

73
00:03:40,699 --> 00:03:41,209
Forceps Shock!

74
00:03:41,408 --> 00:03:43,271
Hyeeaagh!

75
00:03:49,843 --> 00:03:50,905
We did it!

76
00:03:50,905 --> 00:03:53,978
The water conducted electricity, just as Jun planned!

77
00:03:53,978 --> 00:03:55,389
Augh, my car...

78
00:03:55,745 --> 00:03:57,685
Don't get smart with me, you punks!!

79
00:04:01,568 --> 00:04:03,508
Guys, come back!

80
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:11,752
Ha! Did you really think that little plan of yours would be enough to stop me?

81
00:04:11,752 --> 00:04:13,497
Then how about this?

82
00:04:13,497 --> 00:04:14,584
Fleta Z!

83
00:04:16,245 --> 00:04:17,518
Fleta Z, setup!

84
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:23,634
Fleta Z, Beak Arrow!

85
00:04:23,634 --> 00:04:24,740
Beak Arrow!

86
00:04:27,177 --> 00:04:29,408
Heh! This puny arrow is nothing to me!

87
00:04:29,408 --> 00:04:30,899
Now, Fleta Z!

88
00:04:30,899 --> 00:04:31,487
Right!

89
00:04:34,379 --> 00:04:37,200
Why isn't it coming out?! W-What?

90
00:04:37,769 --> 00:04:39,677
I'm losing energy!

91
00:04:39,677 --> 00:04:41,216
Haven't you ever heard of a grounding conductor?

92
00:04:41,216 --> 00:04:45,711
It's a safety device that sends excess electricity from washing machines and refrigerators into the ground!

93
00:04:45,711 --> 00:04:49,492
Now all the energy you absorbed will be sent back into the ground!

94
00:04:49,492 --> 00:04:50,324
You did it!

95
00:04:50,324 --> 00:04:51,503
That's our Jun!

96
00:04:51,503 --> 00:04:54,302
My car!
It's all thanks to you guys!

97
00:04:54,302 --> 00:04:55,691
Why, you little...

98
00:04:57,552 --> 00:04:59,262
How 'bout I share some with you?

99
00:05:00,778 --> 00:05:02,252
Fleta Z, come back!

100
00:05:03,557 --> 00:05:06,220
You brats are starting to get on my nerves!

101
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:07,555
It's about time you've been punished!

102
00:05:07,555 --> 00:05:09,194
Mega Trucker, setup!

103
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:11,685
Shoulder Shield!

104
00:05:14,259 --> 00:05:16,286
How long do you think you can keep that up?!

105
00:05:19,572 --> 00:05:21,483
Mega Trucker can't handle this on his own!

106
00:05:21,483 --> 00:05:22,869
Right. We all have to work together!

107
00:05:23,069 --> 00:05:24,455
Alright. Let's do it!

108
00:05:26,656 --> 00:05:28,423
We all got your back!

109
00:05:28,423 --> 00:05:30,766
Oh! We haven't done this move in a while!

110
00:05:30,766 --> 00:05:32,831
Buffalo Crush! Buster Gallon!

111
00:05:32,831 --> 00:05:34,187
You guys will help too, right?

112
00:05:34,908 --> 00:05:36,737
I guess we don't have a choice.

113
00:05:36,737 --> 00:05:38,625
Buffalo Crush will help you!

114
00:05:40,129 --> 00:05:43,189
And here we have the two shameless traitors.

115
00:05:43,189 --> 00:05:47,946
You sold your souls to that Earthling runt, and now you dare to strike me down?!

116
00:05:47,946 --> 00:05:51,266
Me Buffalo Crush... never sold soul to anyone!

117
00:05:51,266 --> 00:05:51,824
What'd you say?!

118
00:05:52,516 --> 00:05:55,377
Planet Machina gone.

119
00:05:55,377 --> 00:05:58,430
We have to live on Earth now.

120
00:05:58,430 --> 00:06:00,100
You. Me. Everyone!

121
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:01,475
Stop talking!

122
00:06:02,141 --> 00:06:03,449
Oh no!

123
00:06:03,449 --> 00:06:06,232
After exerting all of that energy, he still has the strength to charge his finishing blow?!

124
00:06:07,235 --> 00:06:08,935
Everyone, concentrate on the shield!

125
00:06:08,935 --> 00:06:10,314
Bring it on!

126
00:06:10,314 --> 00:06:11,692
No! There's no time!

127
00:06:13,978 --> 00:06:16,879
Grand... Captain's Cannon!

128
00:06:26,148 --> 00:06:30,519
Oh my. I've never been one to lose my cool,

129
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:32,406
and here I almost ended up destroying the Metal Breath.

130
00:06:33,153 --> 00:06:36,249
Oh no... Everyone? Pull yourselves together!

131
00:06:36,249 --> 00:06:39,391
Now, you are the only ones left.

132
00:06:39,391 --> 00:06:40,853
Run away, Jun!

133
00:06:46,237 --> 00:06:47,399
I can't do that!

134
00:06:48,730 --> 00:06:52,798
Never... I will never run and leave my friends behind!

135
00:06:52,798 --> 00:06:53,776
Ever!

136
00:07:01,213 --> 00:07:02,312
That light...?

137
00:07:02,721 --> 00:07:05,403
Could it be? The light of the forbidden power?!

138
00:07:05,403 --> 00:07:07,189
Forbidden... power?

139
00:07:07,189 --> 00:07:09,689
A legendary force from planet Machina!

140
00:07:09,689 --> 00:07:12,552
So powerful that it had to be sealed away!

141
00:07:12,552 --> 00:07:15,893
I should have known... it existed within the Metal Breath!

142
00:07:15,893 --> 00:07:16,877
Small fry!

143
00:07:16,877 --> 00:07:20,463
Give it to me right now! Hand it over!

144
00:07:20,463 --> 00:07:22,735
I-I don't know what any of that is!

145
00:07:22,735 --> 00:07:24,129
But I will never let you have it!

146
00:07:28,338 --> 00:07:30,628
What is he doing?!

148
00:07:31,129 --> 00:07:34,461
Buster Gallon... You?!

149
00:07:34,461 --> 00:07:35,692
Here you go.

150
00:07:35,692 --> 00:07:38,117
It's all yours now... Captain.

151
00:07:38,117 --> 00:07:39,206
He's kidding, right?!

152
00:07:39,206 --> 00:07:40,389
Did he just betray us?!

153
00:07:40,389 --> 00:07:41,697
This can't be!...

154
00:07:42,137 --> 00:07:44,716
Well done, Buster Gallon!

155
00:07:44,716 --> 00:07:48,269
You... I knew I could always put my trust in you!

156
00:07:48,269 --> 00:07:51,913
With this, the universe will be ours! Hahaha!

157
00:07:51,913 --> 00:07:55,812
What did I tell you?! I knew we shouldn't have taken him in!

158
00:07:57,278 --> 00:07:58,978
I believe I told you.

159
00:07:58,978 --> 00:08:02,000
It is my greatest joy to see the ridiculous look on your faces...

160
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,564
...after you've been tricked.

161
00:08:05,564 --> 00:08:06,487
Yeah!

162
00:08:06,487 --> 00:08:08,478
This is our last chance!

163
00:08:08,478 --> 00:08:11,108
Ack! What is this?!

164
00:08:11,108 --> 00:08:12,269
I can't see anything!

165
00:08:13,858 --> 00:08:15,346
Now's our chance, Buster Gallon!

166
00:08:15,346 --> 00:08:16,295
I'm on it!

167
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:27,490
My energy! After all of this!!

168
00:08:27,781 --> 00:08:29,446
Buster Gallon, setup!

169
00:08:37,638 --> 00:08:39,912
Thank you for believing in me, Captain.

170
00:08:39,912 --> 00:08:42,370
Buster Gallon! Twin Vulcan!

171
00:08:43,913 --> 00:08:45,600
Twin Vulcan!

172
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,306
Buster Blaster!

173
00:08:49,639 --> 00:08:50,879
Buster Blaster!

174
00:08:52,363 --> 00:08:55,604
Who would have thought I'd be betrayed twice!

175
00:08:55,604 --> 00:08:59,514
I must've lost my edge. I don't deserve to be called Captain...!

176
00:08:59,605 --> 00:09:00,792
Jun!

177
00:09:00,792 --> 00:09:01,354
Blue Cop!

178
00:09:09,254 --> 00:09:10,524
Infinity...

179
00:09:10,524 --> 00:09:11,687
Force...

180
00:09:11,687 --> 00:09:13,471
Break!!

181
00:09:29,681 --> 00:09:30,687
This is it!

182
00:09:32,134 --> 00:09:35,211
Metal Cardbot, Change Up!

183
00:09:54,850 --> 00:09:56,624
Black Hook, sealed!

184
00:09:59,134 --> 00:10:00,668
It's over...

185
00:10:01,931 --> 00:10:03,263
You did it, Jun!

186
00:10:04,264 --> 00:10:06,697
For a moment, I thought we were done for...

187
00:10:06,697 --> 00:10:09,359
Hey you, Buster Gallon. Just who's side are you on?

188
00:10:09,359 --> 00:10:10,999
What do you mean, "who's side"?

189
00:10:10,999 --> 00:10:12,446
Don't act like you don't know.

190
00:10:12,446 --> 00:10:14,774
Were you really thinking of betraying us?

191
00:10:14,774 --> 00:10:17,416
I'm not so sure myself. However...

192
00:10:17,416 --> 00:10:18,437
However?

193
00:10:18,437 --> 00:10:20,346
Jun believed in me.

194
00:10:20,346 --> 00:10:23,647
So I started thinking about believing in him too.

195
00:10:23,647 --> 00:10:25,221
Buster Gallon!

196
00:10:25,221 --> 00:10:27,653
Glad to have you on the team!

197
00:10:27,653 --> 00:10:28,817
The pleasure is mine.

198
00:10:32,138 --> 00:10:33,969
Agh!! My arm!!

199
00:10:35,431 --> 00:10:37,278
Jun! Are you alright?!

200
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:42,126
Ehehehe! I got you good! Haha!

201
00:10:42,126 --> 00:10:44,513
Oh, my... you got me this time.

202
00:10:45,644 --> 00:10:47,451
Ugh... really, Jun?

203
00:10:47,451 --> 00:10:50,518
You still have the energy for pranks?

204
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:56,889
Oh... what do I tell the insurance company about this?

205
00:10:56,889 --> 00:11:00,582
Maybe that you made a supreme sacrifice to protect the peace of Mowtown!

206
00:11:00,582 --> 00:11:02,100
That's not gonna work!

207
00:11:02,797 --> 00:11:04,360
It's my dad.

208
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,355
Hello?

209
00:11:05,355 --> 00:11:07,217
What's going on, Daddy?

210
00:11:07,217 --> 00:11:10,388
Anna, where are you right now? Are you okay?

211
00:11:10,388 --> 00:11:13,423
I'm calling because something strange is happening at the landfill.

212
00:11:13,423 --> 00:11:17,735
Look there! A giant mass of ore has just begun to rise out of Landfill 30!

213
00:11:17,735 --> 00:11:20,879
This dome-shaped structure looks large enough to cover the entire landfill!

214
00:11:20,879 --> 00:11:24,490
Should we consider this mysterious phenomenon to be a simple act of nature?!

215
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:27,302
What is that...?

